        "readable_text": "Content:\nLet's compute the following difference:\n\nContent:\n[MATH: 1,456,546 - 1,224,292]\n\nContent:\nAs always, the first step is to line up our numbers according to their place value (ones over ones, tens over tens, hundreds over hundreds, and so on):\n\nContent:\n[MATH: 1|4|5|6|5|4|6; \u2212|1|2|2|4|2|9|2]\n\nContent:\nNext, we proceed by subtracting the numbers in each place value from right to left, borrowing where needed.\n\nContent:\n[MATH: 4|14; 1|4|5|6|5|4|6; \u2212|1|2|2|4|2|9|2; 2|3|2|2|5|4]\n\nContent:\nTherefore, [MATH: 1,456,546 - 1,224,292 = 232,254.]"
